{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y的S01和S05没有分时出现的缓冲，感受文字较密，在19秒和18秒内不如X容易扫完；部分音乐描写也稍显绕远。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的放大亮词让我能迅速抓住每段人物的关键变化，感受又大多跟着音乐逐步出现，更容易把前后的犹豫、靠近、害怕和释然连成一条线。X的完整句子有时把心理因果交代得更透，尤其是为什么暴露喜欢后会失去安全感；但右侧短词同时堆放，容易只留下笼统印象。Y的身体感觉、声音变化和具体场景更能形成细腻的体验，即使来不及读完所有小字，也比较容易感受到情绪怎样一步步变化。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "41d5914d-adb3-4178-a645-af52ccf67087", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T025329764318Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:54:39.084041+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6aa5739312ce4fb6283ab0564624c14703aa41a3d90a5abd43d3d0cd74b1eab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532f